[{"id":9934,"date":"2026-06-23T10:15:04","date_gmt":"2026-06-23T08:15:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/etoropartners.com\/?page_id=9934"},"modified":"2026-07-13T14:05:03","modified_gmt":"2026-07-13T12:05:03","slug":"product-updates-new-features-for-etoro-affiliates","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/etoropartners.com\/product-updates-new-features-for-etoro-affiliates\/","title":{"rendered":"Product Updates: New Features for eToro Affiliates"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<section class=\"wp-block-group wp-block-group-boxed has-white-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group-inner is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-top wp-block-columns-1 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>At eToro, innovation is constant, and we keep introducing product updates designed to provide more flexibility for users across crypto, stocks, and tax-efficient investing. Please see the key details below to help you update your campaigns and communications.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"Tori: The New AI Companion\">A Refreshed eToro Brand<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>eToro has unveiled a refreshed brand identity and a new tagline: &#8220;Know better.&#8221; It reflects a smarter, more personal way to invest \u2014 built around AI, eToro&#8217;s global community, and tools designed to help people make more informed decisions. Watch <a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/live\/YS8gaeiBXt0\">Intelligence in Motion,<\/a> where we made the announcement.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Tori: The New AI Companion<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>eToro has officially relaunched <strong>Tori<\/strong>, upgrading it from a basic companion into a proactive, continuous investing layer. It brings institutional-grade quantitative capabilities to retail traders by learning user habits and providing advanced automation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list wp-block-list wp-block-list-circle\">\n<li><strong>Real-Time Sentiment (Grok 4.2):<\/strong> Powered by an advanced integration with X (formerly Twitter), Tori analyzes real-time social sentiment and global breaking news directly within your natural conversation.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Agent Portfolios:<\/strong> Users can now build dedicated sub-portfolios where Tori executes AI-driven trading strategies autonomously, operating strictly within user-defined risk parameters.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Smart Context &amp; Dashboards:<\/strong> Tori features persistent memory, remembering your trading habits and past conversations over time to deliver a highly personalized dashboard and platform experience.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator wp-block-separator-color-dark-grey wp-block-separator-spaces-medium wp-block-separator-weight-1\"\/>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\"><strong>Expanded Crypto &amp; Wallet Integration<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\">The eToro Money app has been fully integrated into the eToro platform (local currency account management + crypto wallet). The standalone app was sunset in early February 2026. Users can now manage their digital assets directly within the main eToro environment on the wallet tab.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\"><strong>1. Crypto to Portfolio&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\">Users who&#8217;ve made a deposit to eToro can now transfer crypto assets from their wallet directly into their trading portfolio.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\"><strong>Functionality:<\/strong> If a user transfers 1 BTC from the wallet to their portfolio, it automatically opens an equivalent Bitcoin position on the trading platform. This bridges the gap between cold\/hot storage and active trading (crypto assets availability changes between countries) .<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>2. Crypto to Fiat<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Users can sell crypto directly for Fiat currency.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Supported Currencies:<\/strong> Convert crypto into GBP, EUR, AUD, or USD (USD is available in specific countries).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Requirements<\/strong>: This service requires a local currency account (GBP\/EUR\/AUD) the account can be opened for verified users via the deposit flow (via bank transfer) or the wallet tab. see local currency availability<a href=\"https:\/\/www.etoro.com\/money\/availability\"> here<\/a> .<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><br>3. <strong>Crypto Spreads &amp;<\/strong> <strong>Transparency<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>eToro has transitioned to a more transparent pricing model. The 1% commission is now displayed as a separate line item when opening and closing trades, ensuring users see the market price and the fee clearly.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\"><strong>Crypto Staking:<\/strong> Eligible users can grow their crypto holdings by staking supported assets. Supported coins include ETH, SOL, ADA, DOT, ATOM, TRX, NEAR, SUI, and POL (the migration from MATIC is now fully complete). <em>(Note: Staking is not available in Germany or the US, and EU residents must manually opt-in via account settings due to MiCA regulations).<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\"><strong>4. Promotion: 5% StockBack (New!):<\/strong> Users who deposited crypto are eligible to earn 5% back in stocks. See wallet and local currency availability per&nbsp; country <a href=\"https:\/\/www.etoro.com\/money\/availability\">here<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator wp-block-separator-color-dark-grey wp-block-separator-spaces-medium wp-block-separator-weight-1\"\/>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Money<\/strong><strong> <\/strong><strong>Management<\/strong><strong> <\/strong><strong>Tools<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\"><strong>1. Interest on Balance (3.55%)<\/strong> European traders can earn up to <strong>3.55% interest<\/strong> on their uninvested cash balances.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\"><strong>2. Important Promotion Rule:<\/strong> This feature <strong>cannot<\/strong> be promoted as a standalone benefit. It must always be mentioned alongside other eToro products and services.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\"><strong>3. Required Disclosure:<\/strong> \u201cEligibility and Terms &amp; Conditions apply.\u201d<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\"><strong>Stock Lending<\/strong> Active investors can now opt-in to lend their shares to earn extra income. Users retain ownership of the shares while participating in the revenue generated from lending them to other institutions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator wp-block-separator-color-dark-grey wp-block-separator-spaces-medium wp-block-separator-weight-1\"\/>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Regional Compliance &amp; Global Facts<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>UK ONLY<\/strong>: <strong>ISA&#8217;s<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\">For UK residents, eToro (powered by Moneyfarm) now offers three distinct tax-efficient options to suit different investor needs:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\"><strong>1. Cash ISA:<\/strong> eToro account required. Cash ISA held in Qualifying Money Market Fund. *Variable rate correct as of 11\/06\/26. \u00a3500 min. deposit; \u00a315,000 min. existing ISA transfer. To maintain the introductory interest rate, keep a minimum balance of \u00a3500 and limit withdrawals to three per year.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\"><strong>2. DIY Stocks &amp; Shares ISA:<\/strong> For investors who want full control, allowing them to pick their own stocks and ETFs from over 1,000+ assets.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\">*Risk warnings: \u201cThe value of your investments may go up or down. Your capital is at risk. ISA powered by Moneyfarm. ISA rules apply. UK residents only.\u201d<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\"><strong>3. Managed ISA:<\/strong> A &#8220;hands-off&#8221; option where Moneyfarm experts build and manage a diversified portfolio based on the user&#8217;s risk profile.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\">*Risk warnings: \u201cThe value of your investments may go up or down. Your capital is at risk. ISA powered by Moneyfarm. ISA rules apply. UK residents only.\u201d<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\">*<strong>Risk warning if discussing Cash ISA and Stocks and Shares ISA in the same item<\/strong>: <strong><em>\u201c<\/em><\/strong><em>Variable rate correct as of 11\/06\/26. ISA powered by Moneyfarm. The value of your investments may go up or down. Your capital is at risk. ISA rules apply. UK residents only. The Cash ISA interest rate is variable and linked to the secure and protected Qualifying Money Market Fund (QMMF) your money is held in.\u201d<\/em><br><br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\"><strong>Singapore and UAE Regulations<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\"><strong>1. UAE (ADGM):<\/strong> Regulated by FSRA. <strong>Note:<\/strong> Promoting cryptocurrencies is not allowed in the UAE.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\"><strong>2. Singapore (MAS):<\/strong> Licensed under CMSL. <strong>Note:<\/strong> Promoting crypto, copy trading, and Smart Portfolios is not allowed in Singapore.<br><br><strong>New Language<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default\">&nbsp;eToro now available in <strong>Greek<\/strong><strong><br><\/strong><strong><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator wp-block-separator-color-dark-grey wp-block-separator-spaces-medium wp-block-separator-weight-1\"\/>\n\n\n\n<p>Basic Facts for Reference:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Total Users:<\/strong> 40 Million+ | Total Assets: 10,000+<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Leverage<\/strong> (ESMA): 30:1 Majors, 20:1 Minors\/Gold, 5:1 Equities, 2:1 Crypto.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Min Deposit:<\/strong> $50 (varies by country) | Withdrawal Fee: $5 (Min withdrawal $30).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>New Language:<\/strong> Now available in Greek.Number of users: 40+ million<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Available languages:<\/strong> 21<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Broker regulated by the following agencies:<\/strong> FCA (UK), ASIC (Australia), CySEC (Cyprus), GFSC (Gibraltar),&nbsp; ADGM (UAE), MAS (Singapore)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Leverage limitations for ESMA clients:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>30:1 for major currency pairs (such as EUR\/USD)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>20:1 for non-major currency pairs (such as EUR\/NZD), gold and major indices<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>10:1 for commodities with the exception of gold and non-major equity indices<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>5:1 for individual equities and other reference values<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>2:1 for cryptocurrency<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Be aware of the risks associated with leverage;&nbsp; it can multiply both profits and losses.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Leverage limitations for ASIC clients:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Up to 20:1 for certain instruments<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Be aware of the risks associated with leverage;&nbsp; it can multiply both profits and losses.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Total number of assets:<\/strong> Over 10,000&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Number of assets by category:<\/strong> Indices 30+, Currencies 60+, Stocks 9,000+, Commodities 60+, ETF 1000+, Cryptocurrencies 160+<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Minimum first deposit amount:<\/strong> US$50 (<a href=\"https:\/\/www.etoro.com\/customer-service\/help\/523323\/what-is-the-minimum-deposit-amount-on-etoro\/\">minimum first deposit amount per country<\/a>)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Minimum withdrawal amount:<\/strong> US$30<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Withdrawal Fee:<\/strong> $5<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/section>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>At eToro, innovation is constant, and we keep introducing product updates designed to provide more flexibility for users across crypto, stocks, and tax-efficient investing. Please see the key details below to help you update your campaigns and communications. A Refreshed eToro Brand eToro has unveiled a refreshed brand identity and a new tagline: &#8220;Know better.&#8221; [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":20,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"sticky_cta_settings":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-9934","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.1 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>The HUB: Create successful partnerships with eToro<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"eToro affiliates can find a large selection of resources they need to build successful marketing campaigns across many channels and catering to diverse audiences.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/etoropartners.com\/product-updates-new-features-for-etoro-affiliates\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"The HUB: Create successful partnerships with eToro\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"eToro affiliates can find a large selection of resources they need to build successful marketing campaigns across many channels and catering to diverse audiences.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/etoropartners.com\/product-updates-new-features-for-etoro-affiliates\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"eToro Partners\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2026-07-13T12:05:03+00:00\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:l